{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-3934","published":"2026-09-20T13:23:22Z","modified":"2026-09-20T13:30:26.462561660Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-78002"],"summary":"rsyslog security update","details":"RSYSLOG is the rocket-fast system for log processing.It offers high-performance, great security features and a modular design. While it started as a regular syslogd, rsyslog has evolved into a kind of swiss army knife of logging, being able to accept inputs from a wide variety of sources, transform them, and output to the results to diverse destinations.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nRsyslog is an open-source log processing system. The replace() function in the RainerScript scripting language has a heap buffer overflow vulnerability due to incorrect calculation of buffer size (CWE-131), leading to a heap-based buffer overflow (CWE-122). An attacker could exploit this vulnerability to cause denial of service or potential code execution.(CVE-2026-78002)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"rsyslog","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/rsyslog&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["rsyslog-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-crypto-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-debuginfo-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-debugsource-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-elasticsearch-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-gnutls-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-gssapi-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-hiredis-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-kafka-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-mmaudit-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-mmjsonparse-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-mmkubernetes-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-mmnormalize-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-mmsnmptrapd-8.2312.0-13.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","rsyslog-mmtagho